  "root_decisions": [
    "Use accessible collection indexes and explicit exclusions instead of per-artist image quotas.",
    "Keep 58 overlapping computation families/research boundaries distinct from artwork support.",
    "Prioritize composed motif examples plus a narrowly contracted neighborhood/contact slice, then thick paths, elastic growth and selected image/media capabilities. No port sequencing.",
    "Median-cut quantization is already present; image clustering, spatial regions and decoding are separate boundaries.",
    "Independent target springs do not supply elastic bodies; normalized vector relaxation is not automatically a Hooke-law simulation.",
    "Retain 43 excluded-image decisions and separate 29 removed source metadata entries from selected assets; two exact source URL repairs are recorded.",
    "Stop Flickr retries after persistent HTTP 429 responses and retain 383 unavailable URLs explicitly.",
    "Use later animated preview frames to make growth output legible without changing original media."
  ],
  "validation": [
    "Every selected downloaded file hash and byte count checked; source record IDs/census references audited.",
    "Gallery browser passed: 2,023 records, 24 artist filters, Davis 216, Reas 554, text search, a local original-image link and no overflow at 390px.",
    "Before-fix mobile overflow is retained as historical failed evidence."
  ],
  "limits": [
    "24 chosen primary groups are deeply indexed; the remaining thread links are screened rather than fully enumerated.",
    "Local collected evidence reaches 1,988 of 2,023 selected records; 31 McCabe and four GenerateMe records have no local image.",
    "First-frame and later-frame previews do not establish dynamics; exact algorithms remain unassessed for many works.",
    "Palette UI and package acceptance are in a separate bounded review."
  ],
